flowchart LR
    U[Request: user u] --> RET[Retrieval: ANN + co-occurrence + session + popularity]
    RET -->|~500 candidates| RANK[Ranking model]
    RANK --> BIZ[Business rules + diversity + exploration]
    BIZ --> OUT[Top 20 shown]
    FS[(Feature store)] --> RANK
    EV[Interaction events] --> PIPE[Train + build indexes]
    PIPE --> RET
    PIPE --> FS
